<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.54 vs   1.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.16 vs   1.51</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.48 vs   1.80</p>
<p> Sales		   54.20 vs  37.20</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.95 vs   7.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.15 vs  11.77</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.68 vs  10.15</p>
<p> Sales		  347.77 vs 229.54</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
